meta {
  name: Privacy: another writer's noticed never shows mine
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/noticed
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  Run with the second user's token (they have a piece, the first user has an older close one). Expect 200 and `noticed` null, or a note that is the second user's own piece, never the first user's. With the first user's token, `noticed` is null or one of their own older pieces.
}
